              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Spend splits the firm's actual marketing cost by channel mix; referrals are paid by commission. New-matter fees use the average fees billed per matter in the year, weighted by each channel's typical matter value. Test extra spend on a channel in the Simulator: it buys inquiries at 40% of today's cost per inquiry, with diminishing returns, and the team only takes new work up to 95% utilisation.",
